  "readmeFile": "README.NuGet.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fix DarkCheckedListBox: checkboxes/labels are now owner-drawn with proper inset padding so they no longer sit under the control's border. Fix DarkTabControl: each TabPage's own Font (if set) is now used for its header label instead of always the control's shared Font. DarkTextBox's virtual keyboard popup now auto-closes when clicking away from it. Also: fix DarkDateTimePicker's dropdown calendar (dark theme forced on the native popup and its owning frame window, and the popup sized correctly to stop clipping the last week row/columns; added a ShowTime property for editing hour/minute directly in the text). Fix corner/border rendering across several controls (DarkNumericUpDown, DarkTabControl, DarkIoStatusTable); redesign DarkTextBox to fix vertical text centering and add unit suffix, numeric input mode with truncated decimals, and an optional virtual keyboard popup; add DarkIconKind.Keyboard.",
